    a: "For a backyard or a patio — the job you're actually buying it for — yes. The 20W two-way design is why it stays clean at outdoor volume instead of dissolving into crackle. For a parking lot or a block party, no single speaker near this price is, and the ones that come close cost $180 and weigh ten pounds. The real answer for a big space is two speakers spread apart — which is exactly what the 2-pack is for, and a Boom+ pair still costs less than one Charge 6 at list.",
